&lt;li&gt;Fix Media Element Full Screen in Windows when using Multiple Windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2842648379" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2506" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2506/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2506"&gt;#2506&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Windows Media Source bug with Packaged Apps by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2963672547" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2609" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2609/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2609"&gt;#2609&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add missing media3 Stub &lt;code&gt;OnPositionDiscontinuity&lt;/code&gt; back to Android Med… by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3246661420" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2825" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2825/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2825"&gt;#2825&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix MediaElement not working on FlyoutPage in IOS/MAC Catalyst by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2860541193" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2532" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2532/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2532"&gt;#2532&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Media Element fails to load a URL by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ne0rrmatrix/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ne0rrmatrix"&gt;@ne0rrmatrix&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2571337617" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2265" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2265/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2265"&gt;#2265&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following tools are now required for CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="contains-task-list"&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Download/install &lt;a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/" rel="nofollow"&gt;.NET SDK v9.0.306&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Install Xcode 26.0.1 (or higher)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read the &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/wiki/Release-Versions"&gt;latest .NET MAUI Release wiki&lt;/a&gt; to always find the latest-supported version) of Xcode for .NET MAUI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We HIGHLY recommend using the open-source tool &lt;a href="https://github.com/XcodesOrg/XcodesApp"&gt;Xcodes&lt;/a&gt; to easily manage your installed Xcode versions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Update to the latest stable version of Visual Studio (or Jet Brains Rider)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; After installing the latest stable .NET SDK, update to the latest stable version of the .NET MAUI workload:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On macOS, open the Terminal and enter the following command: &lt;code&gt;sudo dotnet workload install maui; sudo dotnet workload update&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Windows, open the command prompt (or Powershell) and enter the following command: &lt;code&gt;dotnet workload install maui &amp;amp;&amp;amp; dotnet workload update&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Add a &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/tools/global-json" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;code&gt;global.json&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; file to your application with the following parameters to ensure you're not using a unsupported preview version of .NET (example below)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The .NET MAUI Community Toolkit does not provide support for preview releases of .NET&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;global.json&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="{
  &amp;quot;sdk&amp;quot;: {
    &amp;quot;version&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;9.0.306&amp;quot;, 
    &amp;quot;rollForward&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;latestFeature&amp;quot;,
    &amp;quot;allowPrerelease&amp;quot;: false
  }
}"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;{
  &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"sdk"&lt;/span&gt;: {
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"version"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-s"&gt;&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;9.0.306&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, 
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"rollForward"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-s"&gt;&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;latestFeature&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;,
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"allowPrerelease"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
  }
}&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/compare/12.2.0...6.1.3-mediaelement"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;12.2.0...6.1.3-mediaelement&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/12.3.0"&gt;12.3.0: Minor fixes and no upper MAUI version restriction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This version brings some minor fixes (but still very important!) and removes the upper version restriction for &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.Maui.Controls&lt;/code&gt;. Although it is not officially supported, you may now use the .NET MAUI Community Toolkit with the .NET 10 preview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for using the .NET MAUI Community Toolkit!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide an extension method to detect if popup was previous page by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/bijington/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/bijington"&gt;@bijington&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3174272851" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2767" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2767/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2767"&gt;#2767&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix memory leak on popups by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/pictos/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/pictos"&gt;@pictos&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3339957129" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2858" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2858/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2858"&gt;#2858&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update BindablePropertySourceGenerator to use partial properties by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/pictos/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/pictos"&gt;@pictos&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3271605730" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2835" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2835/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2835"&gt;#2835&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following tools are now required for CommunityToolkit.Maui:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="contains-task-list"&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Download/install &lt;a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/" rel="nofollow"&gt;.NET SDK v9.0.306&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Install Xcode 26.0.1 (or higher)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read the &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/wiki/Release-Versions"&gt;latest .NET MAUI Release wiki&lt;/a&gt; to always find the latest-supported version) of Xcode for .NET MAUI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We HIGHLY recommend using the open-source tool &lt;a href="https://github.com/XcodesOrg/XcodesApp"&gt;Xcodes&lt;/a&gt; to easily manage your installed Xcode versions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Update to the latest stable version of Visual Studio (or Jet Brains Rider)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; After installing the latest stable .NET SDK, update to the latest stable version of the .NET MAUI workload:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On macOS, open the Terminal and enter the following command: &lt;code&gt;sudo dotnet workload install maui; sudo dotnet workload update&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Windows, open the command prompt (or Powershell) and enter the following command: &lt;code&gt;dotnet workload install maui &amp;amp;&amp;amp; dotnet workload update&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="task-list-item"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"&gt; Add a &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/tools/global-json" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;code&gt;global.json&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; file to your application with the following parameters to ensure you're not using a unsupported preview version of .NET (example below)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The .NET MAUI Community Toolkit does not provide support for preview releases of .NET&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;global.json&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="{
  &amp;quot;sdk&amp;quot;: {
    &amp;quot;version&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;9.0.306&amp;quot;, 
    &amp;quot;rollForward&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;latestFeature&amp;quot;,
    &amp;quot;allowPrerelease&amp;quot;: false
  }
}"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;{
  &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"sdk"&lt;/span&gt;: {
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"version"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-s"&gt;&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;9.0.306&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, 
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"rollForward"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-s"&gt;&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;latestFeature&lt;span class="pl-pds"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;,
    &lt;span class="pl-ent"&gt;"allowPrerelease"&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class="pl-c1"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
  }
}&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/compare/12.2.0...12.3.0"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;12.2.0...12.3.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
